      "weather": "FINE",
      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "EXEMPLARY (1) is a capable type and proved too classy last time to win by 2.25 lengths at this track in a handy 18.27 beating TRUE PROMISES. Ran one of the fastest times on the program in his latest win. Expected to be right there at the finish again. TRUE PROMISES (7) settled back from out wide but wound up hard into the minor money, finishing 2.25 lengths from the winner (18.44) at this track in Grade 5. Good beginner but will need a little luck early crossing from an outside draw. Leading player again. NUKKUNYA (3) jumped favourite and quickly to the front but run down late to finish third (22.87) at Maitland in a Grade 5 over 400m. The form from her last run stacks up well. Expecting another good run. BEST OF SALLY (2) can return to form after missing the top-three at this circuit last time out.",
